WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:05.410
The One Piece Manga has just revealed Vegapunk’s
dream to create free limitless energy for

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:11.840
the entire world, and dropped a major hint
that this lost ancient technology is directly

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:13.980
connected to devil fruits.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:18.750
And speaking of devil fruits from a long time
ago, for the first time after 10 years, we

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:24.810
see Rob Lucci in his Zoan Leopard form encountering
his nemesis Luffy.

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:29.180
As it turns out these two things are actually
directly connected to each other.

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:33.480
Vegapunk’s dream and research about the
limitless energy source are the main reason

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:39.399
that Imu and the Gorosei have ordered his
assassination and ordered CP0 to Egghead island.

00:00:39.399 --> 00:00:44.750
We already speculated that the government
was after Vegapunk because of his knowledge

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:47.190
of ancient technology from the ancient kingdom.

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:52.850
By the way, this is something that’s always
bugged me a little bit, because the name ‘ancient

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:56.730
kingdom is actually a mistranslation’.

00:00:56.730 --> 00:01:01.309
In the original Japanese, it’s actually
called ‘巨大な王国’ which translated

00:01:01.309 --> 00:01:05.040
means ‘The gigantic kingdom’ not the ancient
kingdom.

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:09.810
Which I’ve always thought gives the name
a totally different vibe.

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:15.960
Ancient sounds pretty cool too, but gigantic
makes it sound even more impressive and global

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:18.689
than ancient i would say.

00:01:18.689 --> 00:01:23.320
The Wiki has corrected this to ‘the great
kingdom’, but again kyodai means enormous

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:26.790
or gigantic, which is again completely different
from great.

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:31.829
And it’s not only the adjective that’s
wrong, I think the translation ‘ancient

00:01:31.829 --> 00:01:37.290
kingdom’ has created the impression amongst
western fans, that the ancient weapons are

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:43.360
part of the ancient kingdom, something that
we actually don’t know for a fact.

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:48.180
They could have been weapons owned BY Joy
Boy, but it’s also possible that the ancient

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:53.040
weapons were created by someone else much
earlier and they could even turn out to be

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:56.580
what destroyed the kingdom in the first place.

00:01:56.580 --> 00:02:01.640
Which would explain why Imu uses what could
be to be uranus.

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:06.670
I’m not sure if this translation mistake
was made because both the gigantic kingdom

00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:12.599
and the ancient weapons date back from the
void century or because Kyodai, gigantic,

00:02:12.599 --> 00:02:15.830
and kodai, ancient’ sound so similar.

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:17.160
Sorry for that little rant.

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:19.610
I do think it’s important though.

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:26.620
Because Vegapunk uses Kodai in this chapter
to describe the ancient energy and the ancient

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:27.620
machine soldier.

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:28.620
Kodai enerugi and kodai kikaihei.

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:31.290
I don’t know about you, but to me that sounds
a lot like this ancient robot, as well as

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:37.500
the three ancient weapons were all powered
by this unlimited ancient energy, that Vegapunk

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:39.300
is looking for.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:46.150
Those three actually do share a naming scheme,
unlike the gigantic kingdom.

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:51.010
And i do believe that this mysterious ancient
energy is connected to the power of devil

00:02:55.296 --> 00:03:00.266
Vegapunk’s dream to create limitless free
energy for the world is actually inspired

00:03:00.266 --> 00:03:02.847
by another famous inventor.

00:03:02.847 --> 00:03:08.186
While Vegapunk is already inspired by Einstein
look-wise and has the apple on his head as

00:03:08.186 --> 00:03:14.796
a nod to Newton, his dream is that of Nicola
Tesla, the man who revolutionized technology

00:03:14.796 --> 00:03:19.376
and basically laid the foundation for our
modern technologically advanced civilization.

00:03:19.376 --> 00:03:25.597
In case you don’t know, just like Vegapunk,
Tesla also dreamt of a world where unlimited

00:03:25.597 --> 00:03:29.207
energy could be wirelessly made accessible
to all.

00:03:29.207 --> 00:03:34.356
To create a better world for people and end
the toxic side effect of fossil fuels for

00:03:34.356 --> 00:03:36.957
both humans and the planet.

00:03:36.957 --> 00:03:41.787
One of Tesla’s most extraordinary experiments
in this regard was to transmit electrical

00:03:41.787 --> 00:03:46.797
power over long distances without wires or
cables.

00:03:46.797 --> 00:03:52.616
He planned on building a giant tower using
this technology that would be able to spread

00:03:52.616 --> 00:03:55.307
free electricity around the world.

00:03:55.307 --> 00:04:02.027
His investor at the time, J.P. Morgan, pulled
all his money from Tesla as a result.

00:04:02.027 --> 00:04:08.706
He owned companies making everything from
cables to phone polls to fossil fuel generators.

00:04:08.706 --> 00:04:15.487
He had absolutely no interest in financing
a project that could result in free electricity.

00:04:15.487 --> 00:04:17.347
Was Tesla’s technology real?

00:04:17.347 --> 00:04:19.896
Well he did invent a ton of stuff that worked.

00:04:19.896 --> 00:04:24.366
And it is said that the US Government confiscated
most of his research after his death.

00:04:24.366 --> 00:04:28.317
So we might never know if it was real or not.

00:04:28.317 --> 00:04:33.237
What’s important for us, is that the parallels
to One PIece are clear as day.

00:04:33.237 --> 00:04:38.767
The world government, just like the US government
allegedly would have no interest whatsoever

00:04:38.767 --> 00:04:43.556
in free unlimited energy for the entire planet.

00:04:43.556 --> 00:04:49.556
The Gorosei have worked hard to keep the people
of the world stuck in the 17 hundreds technologically,

00:04:49.556 --> 00:04:53.616
which makes the world easier to control for
them.

00:04:53.616 --> 00:04:57.836
Vegapunk is trying to re-discover this energy
from its use during the void century, similar

00:04:57.836 --> 00:05:03.146
to how Nicola Tesla was said to believe that
the great pyramids of Egypt were actually

00:05:03.146 --> 00:05:07.407
ancient power plants that created clean unlimited
energy.

00:05:07.407 --> 00:05:12.116
I personally am very much fascinated by Tesla
and his work, which has been getting a lot

00:05:12.116 --> 00:05:13.867
more attention again in recent years.

00:05:13.867 --> 00:05:18.267
And I think he is a great inspiration for
Vegapunk’s character.

00:05:18.267 --> 00:05:23.366
However, you might be surprised that this
is not only true in a positive, but also in

00:05:23.366 --> 00:05:25.437
a very negative way.

00:05:25.437 --> 00:05:30.116
It’s pretty much undeniable that Nico Tesla
was one of the brightest thinkers, if not

00:05:30.116 --> 00:05:35.837
the brightest in modern human history, just
like Vegapunk in One PIece.

00:05:35.837 --> 00:05:40.646
However, as a person he was far from a great
guy.

00:05:40.646 --> 00:05:45.896
Not only was he said to be incredibly antisocial
and delusional, but he was also a big believer

00:05:45.896 --> 00:05:52.437
in Eugenics, basically Nazi philosophy, convinced
that certain types of people should be systematically

00:05:52.437 --> 00:05:56.547
eliminated. he wrote that in 1935 by the way.

00:05:56.547 --> 00:05:57.547
Bad timing.

00:05:57.547 --> 00:06:02.427
And as I’ve talked about before in other
videos, Vegapunk shares this much darker side

00:06:02.427 --> 00:06:04.047
to his character too.

00:06:04.047 --> 00:06:09.877
Yes he has good ideals and wants to end wars,
which is why he gets along great with Dragon

00:06:09.877 --> 00:06:16.247
and comes off as a good guy, but he also has
been conducting inhuman and ethically terrible

00:06:16.247 --> 00:06:18.866
experiments on humans and other life forms.

00:06:18.866 --> 00:06:26.056
The cover story with Ceasar and Judge Vinsmoke
thinking of their former glory days just drives

00:06:26.056 --> 00:06:27.827
this point home even more.

00:06:27.827 --> 00:06:33.987
Think of Sanji and his siblings, the kids
on Punk Hazard, Gas weapons and all the military

00:06:33.987 --> 00:06:40.086
assets that Vegapunk has created for the government,
including the Seraphim, that now literally

00:06:40.086 --> 00:06:43.206
have come to take him out in this chapter.

00:06:43.206 --> 00:06:48.667
Vegapunk has good ideals, but doesn’t mind
doing bad things in the name of scientific

00:06:48.667 --> 00:06:49.667
progress.

00:06:49.667 --> 00:06:54.827
I’m actually very curious what direction
Oda will take his character in and if this

00:06:54.827 --> 00:06:58.176
will become a major plot point or not.

00:06:58.176 --> 00:07:03.497
Because Oda has made it a point to show us
both sides of the genius doctor.

00:07:03.497 --> 00:07:07.176
But let’s get back to the ancient energy
and devil fruits.

00:07:07.176 --> 00:07:12.357
If there used to be unlimited power during
the void century, it explains how a technologically

00:07:12.357 --> 00:07:18.447
advanced civilisation was able to reshape
the entire planet and how a war on this level

00:07:18.447 --> 00:07:22.567
could trow society back 500 years.

00:07:22.567 --> 00:07:27.016
I already mentioned that the ancient weapons
and the ancient mechanic soldier were clearly

00:07:27.016 --> 00:07:29.326
powered by this energy.

00:07:29.326 --> 00:07:37.266
Which also means that 200 years ago, when
the Robot attacked Marijois, someone had access

00:07:37.266 --> 00:07:38.567
to this energy.

00:07:38.567 --> 00:07:43.146
So what could it be?

00:07:43.146 --> 00:07:48.427
There is actually one more example of ancient
technology, that uses large amounts of energy.

00:07:48.427 --> 00:07:51.897
The hidden city on the moon that enel discovered.

00:07:51.897 --> 00:07:57.747
The remains of the technologically advanced
sky people, who ran out of resources and thus

00:07:57.747 --> 00:07:59.667
came to earth.

00:07:59.667 --> 00:08:02.146
Maybe this was their attempt at fixing their
ressource problem.

00:08:02.146 --> 00:08:07.027
It might also be the answer to why Vegapunk
is specifically talking about ending wars

00:08:07.027 --> 00:08:14.968
for resources, because so far we haven’t
really seen that be an issue in One PIece

00:08:14.968 --> 00:08:16.387
so far.

00:08:16.387 --> 00:08:23.767
But anyways, this ancient city on the moon
is reactivated by Enels electricity powers.

00:08:23.767 --> 00:08:28.097
Now I have speculated about this mysterious
ancient power source before.

00:08:28.097 --> 00:08:34.816
it could be a form of nuclear fusion, same
as in the sun, which would fit with Luffy

00:08:34.816 --> 00:08:37.527
and his sun god fruit.

00:08:37.527 --> 00:08:42.747
Luffy bringing the dawn could also mean bringing
light in the form of unlimited energy.

00:08:42.747 --> 00:08:45.186
Which i still like a lot.

00:08:45.186 --> 00:08:52.006
But it could also be that Enel and his fruit
are much more important than expected.

00:08:52.006 --> 00:08:56.807
Maybe the man with the god complex really
has the power of a god.

00:08:56.807 --> 00:09:05.147
After all he is able to generate pretty much
unlimited electricity on a ridiculous scale.

00:09:05.147 --> 00:09:09.367
He was able to power the city up with a single
move.

00:09:09.367 --> 00:09:15.207
The goro goro no mi might well be this source
of infinite energy that Vegapunk is looking

00:09:15.207 --> 00:09:16.207
for.

00:09:16.207 --> 00:09:23.196
Or, it could also be that devil fruits themselves
are powered by this infinite energy, which

00:09:23.196 --> 00:09:26.557
allows them to create their powers.

00:09:26.557 --> 00:09:32.127
If devil fruits are actually a technology
and not magic, then the energy for Aokiji

00:09:32.127 --> 00:09:37.487
to freeze an entire ocean or Akainu to melt,
must come from somewhere.

00:09:37.487 --> 00:09:43.217
An infinite energy source powering each fruit
would explain this.

00:09:43.217 --> 00:09:47.987
Which would make Devil Fruits advanced biotechnology.

00:09:47.987 --> 00:09:52.017
Again not that unreasonable an assumption
when you think about Vegapunks scientific

00:09:52.017 --> 00:09:53.686
research of them.

00:09:53.686 --> 00:09:57.707
One crucial and incredibly fascinating thing
that Vegapunk’s research revealed, is that

00:09:57.707 --> 00:10:03.367
being subscribed to my channel will get you
more and better one piece content every single

00:10:03.367 --> 00:10:04.367
week.

00:10:04.367 --> 00:10:08.157
But speaking of the power of devil fruits
and research on them, we of course have to

00:10:08.157 --> 00:10:12.006
talk about the arrival of Lucci and the Seraphim
on the island.

00:10:12.006 --> 00:10:17.756
It looks like all of the Seraphim have not
only lunarian dna, Kizaru’s light powers

00:10:17.756 --> 00:10:22.806
and superhuman strength, but also a devil
fruit.

00:10:22.806 --> 00:10:29.577
Since Kuma’s seraphim has his fruit’s
power, I’m going to assume that warloards

00:10:29.577 --> 00:10:33.537
with a devil fruit power will have their devil
fruit as well.

00:10:33.537 --> 00:10:38.977
So seraphim crocodile will have a sand logia,
moria will have shadow powers and doflamingo

00:10:38.977 --> 00:10:40.207
string powers.

00:10:40.207 --> 00:10:45.607
Meanwhile, it seems like Seraphim of people
who have no fruit, get one that works perfectly

00:10:45.607 --> 00:10:47.427
with their power.

00:10:47.427 --> 00:10:53.667
Jinbei’s version has the swim swim fruit
to work with his fishman karate for instance.

00:10:53.667 --> 00:10:57.746
We have also learned that the Seraphim have
codenames relating to each warloards animal

00:10:57.746 --> 00:10:58.746
theme.

00:10:58.746 --> 00:11:03.837
in case you don’t know, each of the original
7 warloards has some sort of animal reference.

00:11:03.837 --> 00:11:08.246
The 4 that are on Egghead island right now
are Kuma’s Seraphim, S-bear, since Kuma

00:11:08.246 --> 00:11:10.357
means bear in Japanese.

00:11:10.357 --> 00:11:16.037
S-snake must be Boa hancock’s, S-shark is
Jinbei, which means whaleshark in japanese

00:11:16.037 --> 00:11:19.207
and S-hawk is of course Mihawk.

00:11:19.207 --> 00:11:27.367
And boy for Mihawk i cant wait to see what
fruit Oda gave him to complement his sword

00:11:27.367 --> 00:11:28.556
fighting abilities.

00:11:28.556 --> 00:11:33.237
That’s gonna be ridiculously overpowered.

00:11:33.237 --> 00:11:40.327
At the moment, one Seraphim is fighting wiht
CP0, while Vegapunk has given control of the

00:11:40.327 --> 00:11:45.717
other 3 to Sentomaru, the sumo guy from Sabaody
arcapelago.

00:11:45.717 --> 00:11:51.616
He’s not only the first person to use advanced
armament haki in One Piece, but also Vegapunks

00:11:51.616 --> 00:11:54.177
personal guard assigned by the marines.

00:11:54.177 --> 00:12:01.027
Now, Cypher pole is not part of the Marines,
but im still curious to see if Sentomaro will

00:12:01.027 --> 00:12:05.987
actually fight for Vegapunk or will betray
him, which would mean that the straw hats

00:12:05.987 --> 00:12:11.517
would have to face 4 of the seraphim, which
does sound a lot more fair to be honest.

00:12:11.517 --> 00:12:16.217
If a fight were to happen, I’m also curious
who Stussy and Kaku would fight.

00:12:16.217 --> 00:12:20.556
Chopper and Jinbei, because they are with
Luffy?

00:12:20.556 --> 00:12:28.806
But this of course purely depends on whether
or not Lucci is actually foolish enough to

00:12:28.806 --> 00:12:30.117
pick a fight with Luffy.

00:12:30.117 --> 00:12:36.186
Like, dont get me wrong, I do hope and expect
that Lucci has grown a lot stronger over the

00:12:36.186 --> 00:12:37.186
time skip.

00:12:37.186 --> 00:12:44.277
But it would make absolutley no sense that
he’s as strong or stronger than Kaido.

00:12:44.277 --> 00:12:49.496
A leopard is definitley weaker than a dragon,
even if Lucci is awakened at this point.

00:12:49.496 --> 00:12:55.337
If anything there should be more parallels
here with Who’s who, who also is a fromer

00:12:55.337 --> 00:12:58.337
cp9 memeber who ate a cat type devil fruit.

00:12:58.337 --> 00:13:04.357
I was also happy to see that Lucci used his
rokushiki techniques against Atlas here.

00:13:04.357 --> 00:13:09.717
I’m probably not the only one, who felt
like these techniques became a bit useless

00:13:09.717 --> 00:13:10.957
after the introduction of Haki.

00:13:10.957 --> 00:13:16.527
But it looks like Oda is determined to show
that these powers are actually still important

00:13:16.527 --> 00:13:18.467
and useful in the stroy.

00:13:18.467 --> 00:13:25.537
Now, if Lucci actually fights Luffy and Luffy
takes a few hits next chapter or so, i just

00:13:25.537 --> 00:13:30.097
want you to rememeber that luffy barely goes
all out right from the start.

00:13:30.097 --> 00:13:36.006
I can totally see him taking a few hits from
Lucci before he finishes him off quickly.

00:13:36.006 --> 00:13:40.367
But who knows, maybe it’s actually going
to be Kuma who will fight Lucci.

00:13:40.367 --> 00:13:44.686
After all the real kuma is also coming to
Egghead right now.

00:13:44.686 --> 00:13:49.006
And just to throw it out there, it would be
kind of sick if Kuma would send Luffy somewhere

00:13:49.006 --> 00:13:53.217
again this time around.

00:13:53.217 --> 00:13:57.887
And I’m sure Vegapunk still has a lot of
tricks up his sleeve to.

00:13:57.887 --> 00:14:06.487
Especially with his devil fruit power, that
i discussed in a lot of detail in last chapter’s

00:14:06.487 --> 00:14:07.996
review right here.

00:14:07.996 --> 00:14:09.327
Go check that out if you like.

